Usage:
  hedgehug automation [flags]
  hedgehug automation [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Add a rule
  disable     Turn a rule off, or off in one project
  enable      Turn a rule on, or back on in one project
  fields      Show issue_fields, or change it
  list        List the rules, with whether each is on
  rm          Remove a rule

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for automation

Global Flags:
      --json           print JSON
      --no-color       do not color the output
      --store string   the store to work on, by name

Use "hedgehug automation [command] --help" for more information about a command.
hedgehug: a subcommand is needed
